flowchart TD
  A[Start with a project] --> B{Choose a tool}
  B --> C[Write a Markdown checklist]
  B --> D[Draw a Mermaid diagram]
  C --> E[Keep stable task IDs]
  E --> F[Check tasks by hand]
  F --> G[Sync without losing manual checks]
  D --> H[Render the preview locally]
  H --> I[Publish to your workspace]
  I --> J[Point to a node or an area]
  J --> K[Add comments and review]
  K --> L[Save the edit request]
  L --> M[Open the linked Codex chat]
  M --> N[Review the published change]
  classDef task fill:#3e4344,stroke:#627d84,color:#f0f0ed
  classDef review fill:#464239,stroke:#8b7954,color:#f0f0ed
  class A,C,D,E,F,G,H,I task
  class B,J,K,L,M,N review
